/P 101 0 R
/E (For TBRe27, the electrical team is targeting a 4 kg weight reduction through system consolidation and major repackaging, including a custom PDU and VCU. Development of the custom BMS will continue, with more auxiliary and control functions integrated alongside an expanded telemetry system. In parallel, the team is developing an in-house inverter and other power electronics for future introduction.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
